{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And he blessed Joseph.</b> There was no need here for sight, nor for embrace, nor for kissing, and he did not mention what the blessing was." "<b>And he said.</b> After he had blessed Joseph." "<b>The Elohim before whom my fathers walked.</b> You are the Elohim — You are the one before whom my fathers walked; act for their merit." "<b>The Elohim who has been my shepherd.</b> You who have shown kindness to me."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:08.181274312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}